  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1604.04 Application Procedures.\n\n(a) Any person who wishes to apply for a certificate of competency shall:\n\n(1) Appear in person at the department, room 106, during business hours;\n\n(2) Supply proof of identification such as:\n\na. A valid driver's license; or\n\nb. A birth certificate.\n\n(3) Complete the application form, DSSP 84, “Application for Certificate of Competency for the Use of Explosives”, effective May 2013; and\n\n(4) Make payment of the fee as specified in RSA 158:9-c.\n\nSource. #6054, eff 7-1-95, EXPIRED: 7-1-03\n\nNew. #8116, INTERIM, eff 7-14-04, EXPIRES: 1-10-05; ss by #8231, eff 12-20-04; ss by #10396, eff 8-15-13",
